Design sampling for the material population and decision being investigated (@mine-sampling: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @mining-and-mineral-engineering, #source "../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA", #source "../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B", #source "../../../inquiry/metrology/foundations/Sampling-and-representativeness.lingua#r_0F0VEC42GPQPRZM0S7MXF7GAEH", #mining-and-mineral-engineering "Assay-quality-reference-materials-and-data-meaning.lingua#r_492CDYN0TG4DF9KX8ZM8KA19J5") { r_6G69EKR23DGV02YYHKMNNTZF0W
**Read:** [Tratamento de Minérios — CETEM, sixth edition](../sources/Tratamento-de-Minerios-CETEM.lingua#r_04ZQFADZ3NC3T6QDPQ565W1ERA), the complete sampling and mineral-characterization chapters; [Tratamento de Minérios: Práticas Laboratoriais — Sampaio, França, and Braga](../sources/CETEM-Praticas-Laboratoriais.lingua#r_44AAWXB1D7MBR9B0V3TYB8GF9B), the complete sampling/preparation methods used; [A specimen, a sampling target, and a result about a population](../../../inquiry/metrology/foundations/Sampling-and-representativeness.lingua#r_0F0VEC42GPQPRZM0S7MXF7GAEH), the full shared target, support, representativeness, and uncertainty explanation.

Define the target population, property, support volume, spatial/time domain, and intended inference before choosing samples. An exploration interval, blast-hole sample, belt increment, stockpile grab, particle mount, and plant composite represent different material supports and selection mechanisms.

Heterogeneity, segregation, recovery, contamination, preparation, splitting, and analytical measurement can introduce distinct uncertainties or bias. Replicating an assay from one prepared pulp does not assess the original field/stream sampling variability. A large sample count does not remove preferential access or systematic collection error.

Connect sample identity, location/time, material state, collection method, preparation/splitting, analysis, reference materials, and records. Preserve uncollected/missing intervals and changing procedures rather than silently treating them as representative zeros or equivalent observations.

**Work:** design an exploration and a moving-stream study for the same constituent, explaining their different targets and methods. Include suitable independent checks at collection, preparation, and analysis stages, with the uncertainty each can test. Reconstruct one result's complete observation chain and identify what remains untested.

Read the complete CETEM sampling chapters/lab methods and shared metrology explanation. Later resource and metallurgical-accounting studies need this evidence before numerical interpolation or reconciliation can be meaningfully assessed.

**Continue:** [Evaluate assay evidence before turning a table into a model](Assay-quality-reference-materials-and-data-meaning.lingua#r_492CDYN0TG4DF9KX8ZM8KA19J5).

